)\r\n    - You can trigger CTRL-R in the middle of a command to insert the selected item\r\n    - You can delete history items with SHIFT-DEL\r\n- Bug fixes and improvements\r\n    - Fixed unnecessary 100ms delay after `reload` (#4364)\r\n    - Fixed `selected-bg` not applied to colored items (#4372)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Screenshot\r\n\r\n<img width=\"822\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1dcbdc5-905c-4043-857c-28c75a71d94a\" />\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/216345090/reactions","total_count":64,"+1":28,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":14,"confused":0,"heart":13,"rocket":7,"eyes":2},"mentions_count":1},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/213926423","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/213926423/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/213926423/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/junegunn/fzf/releases/tag/v0.61.3","id":213926423,"author":{"login":"junegunn","id":700826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDgyNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/700826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/junegunn","html_url":"https://github.com/junegunn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junegunn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junegunn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junegunn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junegunn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junegunn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junegunn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junegunn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junegunn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junegunn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOANKv9s4MwEIX","tag_name":"v0.61