xt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/tarball/v0.56.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/zipball/v0.56.0","body":"\r\n- Added `--gap[=N]` option to display empty lines between items.\r\n    - This can be useful to visually separate adjacent multi-line items.\r\n      ```sh\r\n      # All bash functions, highlighted\r\n      declare -f | perl -0777 -pe 's/^}\\n/}\\0/gm' |\r\n        bat --plain --language bash --color always |\r\n        fzf --read0 --ansi --reverse --multi --highlight-line --gap\r\n      ```\r\n      <img width=\"855\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b3d2eaf2-bf44-4e3a-8d7b-9878629dd9be\">\r\n    - Or just to make the list easier to read. For single-line items, you probably want to set `--color gutter:-1` as well to hide the gutter.\r\n      ```sh\r\n      fzf --info inline-right --gap --color gutter:-1\r\n      ```\r\n      <img width=\"855\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/113757a1-ccfd-42a6-b946-83533f408e69\">\r\n- Added `noinfo` option to `--preview-window` to hide the scroll indicator in the preview window\r\n- Bug fixes\r\n    - Thanks to @LangLangBart, @akinomyoga, and @charlievieth for fixing the bugs\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/182104815/reactions","total_count":127,"+1":63,"-1":0,"laugh":5,"hooray":20,"confused":0,"heart":22,"rocket":13,"eyes":4},"mentions_count":3},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/172507045","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/172507045/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/172507045/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/junegunn/fzf/releases/tag/v0.55.0","id":172507045,"author":{"login":"junegunn","id":700826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDgyNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/700826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/us