/releases/download/0.33.0/fzf_0.33.0_checksums.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/tarball/0.33.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/zipball/0.33.0","body":"- Added `--scheme=[default|path|history]` option to choose scoring scheme\r\n    - (Experimental)\r\n    - We updated the scoring algorithm in 0.32.0, however we have learned that\r\n      this new scheme (`default`) is not always giving the optimal result\r\n    - `path`: Additional bonus point is only given to the the characters after\r\n      path separator. You might want to choose this scheme if you have many\r\n      files with spaces in their paths.\r\n    - `history`: No additional bonus points are given so that we give more\r\n      weight to the chronological ordering. This is equivalent to the scoring\r\n      scheme before 0.32.0. This also sets `--tiebreak=index`.\r\n- ANSI color sequences with colon delimiters are now supported.\r\n  ```sh\r\n  printf \"\\e[38;5;208mOption 1\\e[m\\nOption 2\" | fzf --ansi\r\n  printf \"\\e[38:5:208mOption 1\\e[m\\nOption 2\" | fzf --ansi\r\n  ```\r\n- Support `border-{up,down}` as the synonyms for `border-{top,bottom}` in\r\n  `--preview-window`\r\n- Added support for ANSI `strikethrough`\r\n  ```sh\r\n  printf \"\\e[9mdeleted\" | fzf --ansi\r\n  fzf --color fg+:strikethrough\r\n  ```\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/75583606/reactions","total_count":52,"+1":32,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":14,"rocket":2,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/73899624","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/73899624/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/junegunn/fzf/releases/73899624/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/junegunn/fzf/releases/tag/0.32.1","id":73899624,"author":{"login":"junegunn","id":700826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDgyNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser